# Euphoria Print — environment variables
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in real values. Never commit secrets.

# --- Stripe (optional) -------------------------------------------------------
# When set, the quote calculator's "Pay & order" button opens Stripe Checkout.
# When unset, the site still works — customers use "Request this quote" instead.
# Use test-mode keys during development.
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=""
STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=""
